  message: "Fixed in WIP PR. Routes subcommand now excludes test-file routes by default. New --include-tests flag opts back in. Legacy -x/--exclude-tests preserved as no-op alias for backward compat. cmd_routes reads args.include_tests instead of args.exclude_tests; default exclusion when neither attribute is set. 3 tests cover new default, --include-tests opt-in, and legacy --exclude-tests still works."  # 3de4
